Study Space 0.2.0

Original implementation for piwin. The learning / review / teaching-assistant
workflow takes inspiration from Pi-Teacher/skills:
https://github.com/Pi-Teacher/skills
No upstream source files or prompt text are redistributed in this package.

The package runs against the host-supplied Pi coding-agent Extension API
(verified with 0.84.2) and typebox (1.1.38). Those dependencies are not bundled;
their licensing remains with the host distribution and their upstream projects.
Native card storage, deduplication and FSRS scheduling remain piwin Host
capabilities; this package contains neither a second scheduler nor a server.
